consumed from [N, Theorem 10.3] are

| Fixed means | Current-ray dimension | Direct rank | Growth vector | Weights | $Q_{\rm vol}$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Neither wall | $5$ | $2$ | $(2,3,4,5)$ | $(1,1,2,3,4)$ | $11$ |
